WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.933 --> 00:00:02.480
(pleasant orchestral music)
(bat cracking)

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.080
- [Narrator] For millions
of Japanese people,

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.460
springtime means one thing: baseball.

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:09.810
But what a fan probably
doesn't think about:

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.800
what happens to all those
broken baseball bats?

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.093
Well, one chopsticks
manufacturer has an answer.

00:00:18.277 --> 00:00:22.670
(bat cracking)
(crowd cheering

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.065
(pleasant orchestral music)

00:00:25.065 --> 00:00:28.982
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:59.180 --> 00:01:00.490
- [Narrator] Wood from the aodamo tree

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.100
was popular for making
fine wooden products

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:04.960
and professional baseball bats.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:07.280
But because of forest tree mismanagement,

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:09.164
the species was in trouble.

00:01:09.164 --> 00:01:13.081
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:39.720
- [Narrator] Instead of
contributing to the problem,

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.845
Mr. Uratani had an idea.

00:01:41.845 --> 00:01:45.762
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:51.080
- [Narrator] With that, Mr. Uratani

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.009
put his plan into motion.

00:01:53.009 --> 00:01:56.926
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:12.521 --> 00:02:15.517
(pleasant orchestral music)

00:02:15.517 --> 00:02:16.600
(bat cracking)

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:17.433
- [Narrator] With the profits from

00:02:17.433 --> 00:02:19.060
these baseball chopsticks,

00:02:19.060 --> 00:02:21.920
Mr. Uratani has joined
baseball leagues and teams

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:26.187
to donate to a group planting
a new forest of aodamo trees.

00:02:26.187 --> 00:02:30.104
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:43.209 --> 00:02:47.626
(bat cracking)
(crowd cheering)

00:02:47.626 --> 00:02:50.709
(electronic dinging)

